#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:1
msgid "软件验证与物理资格"
msgstr "Software validation and physical qualification"

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:3
msgid ""
"本页区分平台软件、Source SDK、文档与物理验收的执行范围。各阶段记录自己的源码、 配置、工具和真实结果；代码、CI 定义或 hash "
"存在不能代替执行。"
msgstr ""
"This page separates execution scopes for platform software, Source SDKs, "
"documentation and physical acceptance. Each stage records its own source, "
"configuration, tools and actual result; code, CI definitions and hashes do "
"not replace execution."

