#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:0
msgid "真实生产 C 路径、模型、ARM ELF、资源预算和 fresh tests"
msgstr ""
"Actual production C paths, models, ARM ELFs, resource budgets and fresh "
"tests"

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:0
msgid "每项绑定实际源码、配置和工具；dirty workspace 只作开发记录"
msgstr ""
"Each result binds actual source, configuration and tools; a dirty workspace "
"provides development records only"

