msgstr "Source SDK"

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:0
msgid "clean HEAD、锁定依赖、许可 manifest、独立 consumer"
msgstr ""
"Clean HEAD, locked dependencies, license manifest and independent consumers"

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:0
msgid "从当前新包实际 configure/build/run/link，核对完整文件映射"
msgstr ""
"Actually configure, build, run or link from the newly exported package and "
