msgid "物理 HIL"
msgstr "Physical HIL"

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:0
msgid "实际 PCB/UID/probe/serial/power/station、同一 image 与预算"
msgstr ""
"Actual PCB, UID, probe, serial, power and station, with the same image and "
"budget"

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:0
msgid "当前硬件未接入，MCU 目标保持 `not_executed`"
msgstr "Equipment is not connected; MCU targets remain `not_executed`"

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:13
msgid ""
"原始命令、报告与产物保存在构建输出或外部交付位置，PR 链接准确源码与实际执行范围。 "
"当前仓库不再维护候选封存、promotion、归档恢复或隔离复现引擎；历史流程从固定源码追溯。"
msgstr ""
"Keep original commands, reports and artifacts in build outputs or an "
"external delivery location; the PR links exact source and actual execution "
"scope. This repository no longer maintains candidate sealing, promotion, "
"archive recovery or isolated reproduction engines; historical workflows "
"remain traceable through fixed source revisions."

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:16
msgid ""
"HIL fixture 和 station template 位于 `tools/hil/fixtures/`。空 station、错误 "
"Board/PCB/芯片／probe／image/config、失效工具文件或不完整预算会被准入拒绝。 "
"准备工装不等于已经刷写、串口测试、测量波形或完成掉电试验。"
msgstr ""
"HIL fixtures and station templates are in `tools/hil/fixtures/`. Admission "
"rejects empty stations, incorrect Board/PCB/chip/probe/image/config, invalid"
" tool files or incomplete budgets. Preparing fixtures is not flashing, "
"serial testing, waveform measurement or completed power-cut testing."

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:25
msgid ""
"USB 的 packet/clock/factory 模型与软件 Board ELF 不提供 VBUS、connector、PHY、 "
"enumeration 或 flush 周期的物理证明。浅 Sleep 的 1 MHz timer 模型只建立被执行 的量化相位合同，真实 "
"clock/PLL/wake/IRQ/catch-up/功耗要用同一镜像测量。Ethernet descriptor "
"OWN/loan、capture/break 与 caller memory pin 的软件模型同样不能 建立电气、吞吐、边沿孔径、功率级安全或 "
"MPU/TZ userspace 隔离。公共 API、模式 配置、SoC provider、reviewed Board "
"route、最终候选与物理执行是不同退出条件。"
msgstr ""
"USB packet/clock/factory models and software-Board ELFs do not physically "
"prove VBUS, connector, PHY, enumeration or flush cycles. The shallow-Sleep 1"
" MHz timer model establishes only the executed quantization-phase contract; "
"actual clock/PLL/wake/IRQ/catch-up/power require measurement on the same "
"image. Ethernet descriptor OWN/loan, capture/break and caller-memory-pin "
"software models likewise establish no electrical, throughput, edge-aperture,"
" power-stage safety or MPU/TZ userspace isolation. Public API, mode "
"configuration, SoC provider, reviewed Board route, final candidate and "
"physical execution have different exit conditions."

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:32
msgid ""
"可返回任务只有真实 kernel detach 后才归还存储；prestart discard 只属于已证明 的启动前 scope。scheduler "
"启动尝试后返回是 retaining fail-stop，不能将内核 返回值解释为从未启动，或撤销可能已经运行的任务、DMA、时钟和外部效果。 停止 "
"I/O 后仍运行的内核继续保留 clock/Tick；产品 reset、设备 safe outputs 和 完整 scheduler-stop port"
" 是外部责任。平台不做自动故障恢复或安全认证声明。"
msgstr ""
"Returning tasks release storage only after actual kernel detach. Prestart "
"discard applies only to proven prestart scope. A scheduler-start attempt "
"that returns is a retaining fail-stop; kernel return cannot mean never "
"started or revoke tasks, DMA, clocks and external effects that may have run."
" A kernel still running after I/O stop retains clock/Tick. Product reset, "
"safe device outputs and a complete scheduler-stop port are external "
"responsibilities. The platform claims no automatic fault recovery or safety "
"certification."

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:38
msgid ""
"Core 的 `nx_fault_observe` 是无默认状态的 best-effort 观察窄端口。FreeRTOS 和 ThreadX 在 "
"retaining fail-stop 路径提供实际 domain/reason/静态源码位置，然后仍 保留全部借用。故障上下文可能已 "
"masked、ISR、unprivileged 或 stack 损坏，观察者 不能假定工作中的 "
"kernel/clock/transport，也不能释放借用、加 OS lock 或重放 请求。hook 返回仍继续停机；fault log、外部 "
"safe output 与受控 reset 分别验收， 不能由 host death test 推断实板异常处理和安全输出已经运行。"
msgstr ""
"Core `nx_fault_observe` is a best-effort observation narrow port with no "
"default state. FreeRTOS/ThreadX retaining fail-stop paths supply actual "
"domain/reason/static source position and retain all borrows. Fault context "
"may be masked, ISR, unprivileged or stack-corrupted. Observers cannot assume"
" a working kernel/clock/transport, release borrows, take OS locks or replay "
"requests. Returning hooks still proceed with halt. Fault logging, external "
"safe output and controlled reset are separately accepted; host death tests "
"do not imply executed physical exception handling or safe outputs."

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:45
msgid ""
"验证记录应保留原始命令、退出码、JUnit、模型、预算与 binary 身份。源码或产物 变化后重新执行适用检查，文档更新不继承历史资格。CI 与 "
"SDK 消费也不自动完成 产品发布。"
msgstr ""
"Validation records retain original commands, exit codes, JUnit, models, "
"budgets and binary identities. Re-execute applicable checks after source or "
"artifact changes; documentation updates do not inherit historical "
"qualification. CI and SDK consumption do not automatically perform a product"
" release."

#: ../../../docs/delivery/qualification.md:49
msgid ""
"实板接入后优先复核安全输出、clock/reset、UART TC/cancel/RX loss、SPI/I2C、Flash "
"掉电、watchdog、EXTI/PWM/ADC，再测 cycles/latency/high-water 与长期负载。私有 "
"产品策略、现场部署、密钥与制造许可由外部工程承接。"
msgstr ""
"After hardware connection, first check safe outputs, clock/reset, UART "
"TC/cancel/RX loss, SPI/I2C, Flash power cuts, watchdog and EXTI/PWM/ADC; "
"then measure cycles/latency/high-water and sustained load. External projects"
" own private product policies, field deployment, keys and manufacturing "
"permissions."

msgid "当前生产 SoC 只维护 F4，精确器件与模式见[支持范围](support.md)。F407 Board 与 新增料号的内部 CRC 软件参考分别记录，不把某一参考的 ARM／SDK 结果扩展到全部 模式。其他系列原始记录保留原源码身份。ThreadX、FreeRTOS、Native、寄存器模型、 ARM 链接与物理执行分别判断，链接程序不证明 scheduler 已运行；本轮结果不继承历史计数。"
msgstr "F4 is the only production SoC scope; see [support scope](support.md) for exact devices and modes. F407 Boards and internal-CRC software references for added parts are recorded separately; ARM/SDK evidence for one reference does not extend to every mode. Records for other series retain their original source identity. ThreadX, FreeRTOS, Native, register models, ARM linkage and physical execution are assessed separately. A linked program does not prove scheduler execution, and current results inherit no historical counts."
